# The image build context is an allow-list: only what `uv sync` needs to install the API (and the
# worker, a workspace member the lockfile names).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!apps/
!packages/
!workers/
# The reviewed registry and the action contracts the worker's Action Gateway loads (slice 5.4).
!registry/
packages/contracts/
!packages/contracts/actions/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
